localizedName: Svitton
description: A massive, dark world captured by the Serpulo-Erekir sun centuries ago, Zeg is locked in a perpetual state of extreme cold. Its crushing atmospheric pressure and dense cloud layers trap violent, unending blizzards that scour the surface, with winds howling constantly in shifting gales. Temperatures never climb above -97°C, and plunge as low as -179°C in the long shadows. With over 73% of its crust permanently sealed under glacial ice and compacted snow, sunlight barely pierces the thick haze, casting the planet in an eternal, dim twilight. Despite its crushing mass and hostile climate, factions have already begun to dig into the frozen crust... unaware of what might lie dormant beneath the ice.
alwaysUnlocked: true
